<title>INDIA: India can draw $200bln from overseas Indians - Joshi.</title>
<headline>India can draw $200bln from overseas Indians - Joshi.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of India's richest state said on Monday that the country could attract up to $200 billion from expatriate Indians.</p>
<p>&quot;I am told that as many as $150-200 billion can easily be channelled by overseas Indians into our country,&quot; said Manohar Joshi, chief minister of western Maharashtra state.</p>
</text>
